WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.960
OP

00:00:01.040 --> 00:00:10.820
Request from Ichigo... when watching the television, sit a safe distance from the television in a well-lit room.

00:00:03.260 --> 00:00:08.480
Whenever there's a battle, though, my little heart beats so fast that it might burst!

00:00:08.480 --> 00:00:11.280
Liar! Your heart's as big as a whole cake!

00:00:11.280 --> 00:00:12.280
What did you say!?

00:00:12.280 --> 00:00:14.970
Ahh, I want to eat a big whole cake...

00:00:14.970 --> 00:00:20.430
No, that's not it, what she meant was that your heart was as big and brash and insensitive and cold as a whole cake-

00:00:20.430 --> 00:00:23.190
The whole cake's eating Cafe!

00:00:23.190 --> 00:00:26.750
Take a bite of Caramel and you'll ruin your stomach!

00:00:30.800 --> 00:00:37.090
fuwa fuwa funwari amakute toro kechau

00:00:30.800 --> 00:00:37.090
Fluffy, fluffy, fluffiness, so sweetly it melts.

00:00:37.120 --> 00:00:42.480
shiawase wo ageru yo yumeiro no pâtishièeru<i>!!</i>

00:00:37.120 --> 00:00:42.480
I'll give you happiness, the dream-coloured Pâtissière<i>!!</i>

00:00:42.520 --> 00:00:47.980
ichigo furejie & furanbowaazu, hapihapi makaron, hapinesu made go!

00:00:42.520 --> 00:00:47.980
Strawberry Fraisier & Framboise, happy happy Macaron, Happiness made go!

00:00:47.980 --> 00:00:53.150
chansu no tobira aketa toki kara kibun joujou ↑ ↑

00:00:47.980 --> 00:00:53.150
Since I opened the door of chance, my mood lifted.

00:00:53.150 --> 00:00:57.110
youkoso suiitsu no oukoku he

00:00:53.150 --> 00:00:57.110
Welcome to the Kingdom of Sweets.

00:00:57.210 --> 00:00:57.990
Bon appétit!

00:00:57.990 --> 00:01:05.370
hajimehane, hetappi demo megezu ni hibishoujin<i>!</i>

00:00:57.990 --> 00:01:05.370
Though I was terrible at the beginning, I was diligent everyday<i>!</i>

00:01:05.370 --> 00:01:08.040
「makeruna<i>! atashi」</i>

00:01:05.370 --> 00:01:08.040
「I won't lose<i>!</i> I said to myself」

00:01:08.260 --> 00:01:09.100
Courage!

00:01:10.250 --> 00:01:15.800
My dream migakeba hikaru takaramono

00:01:10.250 --> 00:01:15.800
My dream when polished is a shining treasure.

00:01:15.800 --> 00:01:18.550
fairy chikara kashite<i>!</i>

00:01:15.800 --> 00:01:18.550
Fairy, lend me your strength<i>!</i>

00:01:18.550 --> 00:01:23.930
shifon, se shibon, juré, bonjuuru, hatsuratsu furuutsu, raburii made go!

00:01:18.550 --> 00:01:23.930
Chiffon, C'est si bon, Gelée, Bonjour, Lively fruits, Lovely made go!

00:01:23.930 --> 00:01:30.060
nakitaku natte mo egao ni nareru mahou

00:01:23.930 --> 00:01:30.060
Even if you cry, there is magic that can make you smile.

00:01:30.060 --> 00:01:35.280
「oishii<i>!」 wo tsukurutte omoikkiri tanoshii ne</i>

00:01:30.060 --> 00:01:35.280
「Delicious<i>!</i>」 and making it wholeheartedly is fun.

00:01:35.280 --> 00:01:41.280
fuwa fuwa funwari amakute toro kechau

00:01:35.280 --> 00:01:41.280
Fluffy, fluffy, fluffiness, so sweetly it melts.

00:01:41.280 --> 00:01:46.620
shiawase wo ageru yo yumeiro no pâtishièeru<i>!!</i>

00:01:41.280 --> 00:01:46.620
I'll give happiness to you, the dream-coloured Pâtissière<i>!!</i>

00:01:46.620 --> 00:01:51.170
ichigo furejie & furanbowaazu, hapihapi makaron, fun fun

00:01:46.620 --> 00:01:51.170
Strawberry Fraisier & Framboise, happy happy Macaron, fun, fun

00:01:51.170 --> 00:01:53.380
yume ni eeru<i>!</i>

00:01:51.170 --> 00:01:53.380
Get them in our dreams<i>!</i>

00:01:53.650 --> 00:01:57.900
Presented by Wasurenai-subs

00:01:58.590 --> 00:02:05.440
Good morning. Yumeiro Pâtissière is brought to you by Konami and these other sponsors.

00:02:08.400 --> 00:02:11.730
To be able to get this far... It feels like a dream!

00:02:12.170 --> 00:02:15.160
That's because Kashino is here. It's a given.

00:02:15.160 --> 00:02:17.290
Still, now that we've come this far...

00:02:17.290 --> 00:02:18.670
We really should aim for...

00:02:18.670 --> 00:02:20.910
The Cake Grand Prix championship victory!

00:02:23.030 --> 00:02:25.650
Ichigo-chan, it's finally time for the main event, eh?

00:02:25.650 --> 00:02:29.150
Yeah! Now's the time to "cake" it up a notch! Or something!

00:02:29.620 --> 00:02:31.740
Yummy~

00:02:31.740 --> 00:02:34.080
You're in top form today, Ichigo-chan!

00:02:34.080 --> 00:02:36.800
If you keep this up, the first round'll be a piece of cake for you!

00:02:39.240 --> 00:02:42.490
Huh? Kana-chan, these aren't cakes...

00:02:42.490 --> 00:02:45.470
It's cause I've been putting on weight recently...

00:02:45.470 --> 00:02:49.200
Kana-chan's been dieting in order to not lose <i>that</i> person's favour, eh?

00:02:49.200 --> 00:02:51.850
Must be tough being the hostess of a Japanese confectionery eh?

00:02:52.230 --> 00:02:52.950
Shh!

00:02:52.950 --> 00:02:55.070
Kana-chan, you're gonna work at a Japanese confectionery?

00:02:55.440 --> 00:02:57.780
Ichigo-chan, you haven't changed a bit.

00:02:58.140 --> 00:03:00.180
So, what are these?

00:03:00.180 --> 00:03:05.490
Organic cookies. They're healthy and delicious, and are masterpieces by Tachibana Azuki-senpai.

00:03:05.930 --> 00:03:07.650
Organic cookies?

00:03:09.570 --> 00:03:11.250
If you'd like, have some.

00:03:11.250 --> 00:03:14.210
Can I!? Wow, Kana-chan, thank you!

00:03:15.250 --> 00:03:17.450
Itadakimasu!

00:03:18.380 --> 00:03:23.550
<i>Delicious! The longer I chew, the sweeter it gets...</i>

00:03:24.030 --> 00:03:27.280
<i>Whole wheat flower, olive oil, honey...</i>

00:03:27.280 --> 00:03:32.650
<i>It's as if Gaia herself put her homemade touch on these gently baked cookies!</i>

00:03:32.650 --> 00:03:38.400
I've only had sweets lavished with butter, eggs, and fresh cream up until now,

00:03:38.400 --> 00:03:40.610
but these simple cookies are awesome!

00:03:41.120 --> 00:03:47.430
I'll be able to experience many new tastes like these organic cookies in the Cake Grand Prix, right?

00:03:47.430 --> 00:03:48.660
Yup! That's right.

00:03:49.750 --> 00:03:51.620
I can't wait!

00:03:51.640 --> 00:03:57.650
recipe 31

00:03:51.640 --> 00:03:57.650
The Princess and Ojou

00:03:58.500 --> 00:04:07.120
Now, everyone, our academy's most glorious event, the Cake Grand Prix has begun.

00:04:07.120 --> 00:04:10.680
Everyone, I hope that you are all looking forward to it.

00:04:10.680 --> 00:04:14.800
And without further ado, let us present the tournament listings.

00:04:16.360 --> 00:04:18.690
Team   Ichigo

00:04:16.360 --> 00:04:18.690
Team  Tanaka

00:04:17.190 --> 00:04:18.690
Team  Tachibana

00:04:18.690 --> 00:04:22.590
So our opponent for the first round is Team Tachibana, huh.

00:04:22.590 --> 00:04:23.700
Haven't heard of them before...

00:04:23.700 --> 00:04:28.330
I know them! They have Tachibana-senpai, the one who makes organic sweets, right?

00:04:28.330 --> 00:04:30.200
Precisely. Quite observant of you.

00:04:30.720 --> 00:04:34.920
They're four girls that are also known as "Country Girls". See there?

00:04:35.560 --> 00:04:41.420
I've shared some Japanese refined sugar once with the leader, Tachibana-senpai, so we've met before.

00:04:41.950 --> 00:04:45.960
She's a genius at making sweets using ingredients that are good for you.

00:04:45.960 --> 00:04:47.430
Quite a formidable opponent.

00:04:47.430 --> 00:04:49.920
Ah, formidable, huh?

00:04:49.920 --> 00:04:54.980
Speaking of formidable, I wonder which team is unlucky enough to face against Tennouji's team first?

00:04:54.980 --> 00:04:57.120
Now that you mention it, me too...

00:04:56.670 --> 00:04:58.710
    Team   Tennouji
Team   Koshiro
Team   Kishigawa
Team   Takai
Team   Yamashita
Team   Suzuki
Team   Kosugi
Team   Minobe
Team   Yoshida
Team   Natsuki

00:04:58.700 --> 00:05:00.580
Team Koshiro!?

00:05:00.580 --> 00:05:03.840
President Tennouji against Ojou?

00:05:03.840 --> 00:05:05.600
This is gonna be something...

00:05:07.520 --> 00:05:11.910
It's good, isn't it? I couldn't ask for a more befitting opponent.

00:05:11.910 --> 00:05:19.250
I don't care if she's the student president or Henri Lucas's star pupil,
but when it comes to making sweets and having piping hot good looks,

00:05:19.250 --> 00:05:21.420
she's just totally ripping off my character!

00:05:22.340 --> 00:05:23.630
O-Ojou-sama!

00:05:23.630 --> 00:05:25.170
Your voice is too loud!

00:05:25.170 --> 00:05:32.970
I'll win this match and remind everyone exactly who has far superior skill and beauty!

00:05:32.970 --> 00:05:35.820
That's one heck of a glare...

00:05:35.820 --> 00:05:36.980
She's scary!

00:05:36.980 --> 00:05:38.490
What did you say!?

00:05:38.490 --> 00:05:39.810
No, nothing!

00:05:39.810 --> 00:05:45.530
Team   Yamashita
Team   Suzuki
Team   Kosugi
Team   Minobe
Team   Natsuki
Team   Ishii
Team   Itou

00:05:40.100 --> 00:05:46.070
Now, moving on, I would like to announce the theme.

00:05:46.070 --> 00:05:49.840
The theme for the first round is this.

00:05:51.860 --> 00:05:54.370
Huh? Elephants?

00:05:55.470 --> 00:05:58.740
Ojou-sama, you read that as <i>elegance</i>.

00:05:58.740 --> 00:06:00.220
It means "refinement".

00:06:00.220 --> 00:06:01.270
Refinement?

00:06:01.270 --> 00:06:03.950
Well, isn't that just perfect for me!

00:06:05.700 --> 00:06:10.170
I shall be looking forward to the "elegant" cakes made by everyone.

00:06:10.170 --> 00:06:11.260
Let us begin!

00:06:13.020 --> 00:06:15.310
This match will be all mine!

00:06:15.740 --> 00:06:17.000
Elegance, huh...

00:06:17.000 --> 00:06:19.270
It's a theme that fits your specialty, eh?

00:06:19.270 --> 00:06:20.630
Undoubtedly.

00:06:20.630 --> 00:06:25.410
Umm, I don't really know what "elegance" means...

00:06:25.410 --> 00:06:29.360
The term "elegance" was coined from the allure of the royal courts.

00:06:29.770 --> 00:06:32.730
Aptly practical, with extravagance in moderation.

00:06:32.730 --> 00:06:35.180
Sophisticated, yet reasonably unorthodox.

00:06:35.180 --> 00:06:37.080
I don't get it at all!

00:06:37.660 --> 00:06:40.070
To put it simply, I'm elegant,

00:06:40.070 --> 00:06:41.500
and he isn't.

00:06:41.500 --> 00:06:43.140
Now I get it!

00:06:43.140 --> 00:06:44.800
Don't you use me like that!

00:06:44.800 --> 00:06:47.000
Hehe, my bad.

00:06:47.760 --> 00:06:49.510
Elegance, huh...

00:06:50.530 --> 00:06:55.810
My, the Country Girls look noticeably worried.

00:06:55.810 --> 00:07:02.290
Since Team Tachibana often do better with natural tastes, elegance is a mismatched theme for them.

00:07:02.290 --> 00:07:07.570
Elegance, huh? I can't picture it. It's not an everyday word for me.

00:07:07.570 --> 00:07:10.570
Well then, everyone, how about we head over to my house?

00:07:11.210 --> 00:07:13.780
Let's hold a meeting to lay out our plan.

00:07:13.780 --> 00:07:15.080
At your house?

00:07:15.080 --> 00:07:16.230
Yeah.

00:07:17.760 --> 00:07:20.630
The theme is "elegance". Let's work hard!

00:07:20.630 --> 00:07:26.950
Azuki, I'm kinda worried, since the sweets we make are plain and simple, right?

00:07:26.970 --> 00:07:30.190
Vividness is important in the world of elegance,

00:07:30.190 --> 00:07:33.720
so don't you think that we shouldn't fixate ourselves so much on organic ingredients, just this once?

00:07:33.730 --> 00:07:39.600
If we need colour, we can just add purple sweet potatoes or jasmine, or freshly squeezed fruit juice!

00:07:39.600 --> 00:07:46.480
We're going to fight without using artificial ingredients, just like we've always done!

00:07:46.480 --> 00:07:50.030
Even if it's the Cake Grand Prix, this is a matter I must uphold!

00:07:51.560 --> 00:07:53.530
You're right. It's just as you say.

00:07:53.980 --> 00:07:57.260
We'll just have to do things our own way!

00:07:57.260 --> 00:07:58.380
Yeah!

00:07:58.650 --> 00:08:03.210
It looks like the Country Girls are going to fight with organic sweets, as usual.

00:08:03.210 --> 00:08:06.600
Organic and elegance doesn't go together!

00:08:06.600 --> 00:08:09.800
I'm looking forward to what they'll be making as our rivals.

00:08:09.800 --> 00:08:12.800
Now then, let's check up on the other teams too!

00:08:13.680 --> 00:08:15.800
This is Ojou's house.

00:08:15.810 --> 00:08:17.670
That's an incredible mansion...

00:08:17.670 --> 00:08:18.430
So big...

00:08:18.430 --> 00:08:19.520
As expected of Ojou, huh?

00:08:23.480 --> 00:08:24.810
It's finished!

00:08:24.830 --> 00:08:26.010
Wow...

00:08:26.640 --> 00:08:31.240
Your skills are certainly admirable, Morris. This extravagant cake is just magnificent.

00:08:31.240 --> 00:08:34.950
No, no! It's not an extravagant cake.

00:08:34.950 --> 00:08:37.720
It's called pièce montée.

00:08:34.950 --> 00:08:41.210
TL Note: See live action for an explanation.

00:08:37.720 --> 00:08:41.210
Conventional cake sculpture from France.

00:08:41.210 --> 00:08:43.580
Ojou-sama, if we master this skill...

00:08:43.580 --> 00:08:46.040
We'll score perfectly in the artistic category of the Grand Prix!

00:08:46.040 --> 00:08:47.720
Undoubtedly...

00:08:48.240 --> 00:08:51.090
Morris, give us lessons immediately!

00:08:51.090 --> 00:08:54.090
My lessons are <i>very</i> strict.

00:08:54.090 --> 00:08:58.670
I don't care. I am staking my life on the Cake Grand Prix!

00:08:58.670 --> 00:09:02.430
I will never lose! This is to get Makoto-kun, too!

00:09:02.430 --> 00:09:05.590
Très bien! What enthusiasm!

00:09:05.590 --> 00:09:07.260
Now then...

00:09:07.260 --> 00:09:10.810
Please whip the whites and then make the icing.

00:09:10.810 --> 00:09:11.950
An effortless task.

00:09:11.950 --> 00:09:12.740
In five minutes.

00:09:12.740 --> 00:09:14.330
Five minutes!?

00:09:14.330 --> 00:09:17.820
There is a time limit for making sweets in Grand Prix.

00:09:17.820 --> 00:09:19.740
As such...

00:09:19.740 --> 00:09:22.490
Do it in silence, immediately!

00:09:25.200 --> 00:09:28.680
Ojou is being trained on pièce montées by a pro, huh...

00:09:28.680 --> 00:09:31.210
Getting whipped around like this with orders... serves her right!

00:09:31.210 --> 00:09:35.550
But her skills just might actually improve from all this, wouldn't they?

00:09:35.550 --> 00:09:38.040
No good! Do it again!

00:09:38.040 --> 00:09:39.550
Again!?

00:09:42.050 --> 00:09:43.880
Excuse us!

00:09:43.880 --> 00:09:45.630
Welcome.

00:09:45.630 --> 00:09:49.450
Tada! I borrowed a ceremonial kimono!

00:09:49.450 --> 00:09:51.340
Looks pretty good on her, right?

00:09:51.340 --> 00:09:57.030
I was thinking of letting Ichigo-chan have a taste of elegance, so I asked my mother if she could wear it.

00:09:57.030 --> 00:09:58.070
Well?

00:09:58.070 --> 00:10:00.780
Yeah, it looks great on you.

00:10:00.780 --> 00:10:01.880
You're really bundled up there.

00:10:01.880 --> 00:10:02.790
For sure.

00:10:02.790 --> 00:10:07.210
What's with that!? This took me two whole hours to put on, you kn-

00:10:12.670 --> 00:10:14.160
Ow...

00:10:14.160 --> 00:10:14.960
You're such a klutz.

00:10:15.380 --> 00:10:17.140
Are you all right, Ichigo-chan?

00:10:17.140 --> 00:10:19.680
When you're wearing a kimono, you need to be graceful.

00:10:19.680 --> 00:10:23.830
It's pretty hard to give off the "allure" part of elegance, huh...

00:10:23.830 --> 00:10:28.150
Kimonos are hard on my shoulders, hot, and difficult to walk in...

00:10:28.150 --> 00:10:32.800
But the royalty back then would keep their composure, never complaining about such things,

00:10:32.800 --> 00:10:35.690
all while wearing these ceremonial kimonos, right?

00:10:35.990 --> 00:10:40.070
The ceremonial kimono is a garment that arose in the royal families of the Heian period.

00:10:35.990 --> 00:10:48.390
TL Note: The Heian period (平安時代, Heian jidai) is the last division of classical Japanese history, running from 794 to 1185.

00:10:40.630 --> 00:10:43.990
In those days, the noblewomen, concerned with their appearances,

00:10:43.990 --> 00:10:48.390
competed with each other over the beauty of countless layers of silk kimonos.

00:10:48.390 --> 00:10:52.690
The magnificence of the Heian period, as well as its extravagance,

00:10:52.690 --> 00:10:54.500
would be perfect for the theme of elegance for this round, don't you think?

00:10:54.500 --> 00:10:57.960
I see. You're quite knowledgeable at this, huh.

00:10:57.960 --> 00:11:00.680
"The Tale of Genji" is a favorite story of mine.

00:10:57.960 --> 00:11:00.680
TL Note: <i>Genji Monogatari</i> (源氏物語), a classic Japanese literary work by the noblewoman Murasaki Shikibu in the Heian period.

00:11:00.680 --> 00:11:04.420
Hikaru Genji and I have something in common.

00:11:00.680 --> 00:11:05.510
Hikaru Genji is the protagonist, described as the most handsome man in the world, attracting all women.

00:11:05.510 --> 00:11:11.230
The thousand-year capital, Kyoto... using the Heian period as a motif certainly isn't a bad idea.

00:11:05.510 --> 00:11:11.230
TL Note: This refers to when Kyoto (called Heian-kyo at the time) was the imperial capital of Japan from 794 to 1868 BCE.

00:11:11.240 --> 00:11:15.270
Now that it's been decided, how about we come up with a plausible design?

00:11:15.270 --> 00:11:19.240
Ever since, all of the other competing teams have been doing as they pleased, and...

00:11:29.370 --> 00:11:33.500
What's with this boring play?

00:11:33.500 --> 00:11:38.880
Everyone's secluded themselves practicing in the cooking classrooms, but President Tennouji is just watching something like this...

00:11:39.300 --> 00:11:42.380
It's like she doesn't have any motivation at all.

00:11:53.900 --> 00:11:56.900
In what seemed like a blink of an eye, the day of the showdown had arrived.

00:12:01.170 --> 00:12:04.770
Kashino's on chocolate, and Hanabusa-kun's got the candy!

00:12:04.770 --> 00:12:08.950
Looks like Ichigo-chan and Andou-kun are making the cake itself.

00:12:10.440 --> 00:12:13.600
Team Tachibana's performance!

00:12:13.600 --> 00:12:18.670
In the cake Grand Prix, you're graded on how much you can show off your cake making performance!

00:12:18.680 --> 00:12:21.910
Looks like they aren't using food colouring,

00:12:21.910 --> 00:12:25.620
but instead using ground purple sweet potatoes, foxberries, and jasmines.

00:12:25.620 --> 00:12:28.820
As expected of the organic sweets masters, the Country Girls.

00:12:28.820 --> 00:12:32.260
Those minute details will help them score well.

00:12:32.260 --> 00:12:37.270
Ichigo-chan and the others are using azuki beans and powdered green tea, so they're treating natural ingredients importantly as well.

00:12:37.270 --> 00:12:40.890
Look, they're using classical colours right to the very end.

00:12:40.890 --> 00:12:42.900
This'll be quite the battle...

00:12:56.790 --> 00:12:58.870
Ichigo, how's it going?

00:12:58.870 --> 00:13:03.660
Perfect! Right now I have to make a lot of flower petals.

00:13:03.660 --> 00:13:04.930
Have to keep going!

00:13:06.770 --> 00:13:10.740
The Country Girls are making their special baked sweets, eh?

00:13:10.740 --> 00:13:12.700
Ichigo, you've got to concentrate!

00:13:12.700 --> 00:13:14.520
Oops! Right, right...

00:13:31.070 --> 00:13:32.660
Fifteen minutes remaining.

00:13:33.150 --> 00:13:36.660
Add more feathers! We're gonna make this gorgeous!

00:13:36.660 --> 00:13:37.710
Got it!

00:13:45.660 --> 00:13:48.760
It's finally time for Team Ichigo's performance, eh?

00:14:07.650 --> 00:14:09.380
Done...

00:14:09.390 --> 00:14:12.230
Wonderful! It looks just like a real flower arrangement!

00:14:12.230 --> 00:14:15.170
Everyone, let's make it into a card!

00:14:15.170 --> 00:14:16.370
One, two...

00:14:16.780 --> 00:14:17.940
Magical macaron!

00:14:17.940 --> 00:14:19.940
Sweets Romance Card!

00:14:19.940 --> 00:14:22.190
Come out!

00:14:32.440 --> 00:14:34.960
So Team Tachibana did a peacock, huh?

00:14:34.960 --> 00:14:36.600
It shows considerable punch.

00:14:36.600 --> 00:14:39.560
We've done our best. Now we only have to wait for the results.

00:14:39.560 --> 00:14:42.560
Well then, we will announce the scores.

00:14:47.380 --> 00:14:49.950
No! This can't be-

00:14:49.060 --> 00:14:52.120
Step back. It is being judged.

00:15:02.010 --> 00:15:04.210
Now, starting from Team Ichigo.

00:15:04.750 --> 00:15:06.590
Flavour: 83 points.

00:15:06.590 --> 00:15:08.180
Skills: 88 points.

00:15:08.180 --> 00:15:10.630
Theme: 86 points.

00:15:10.630 --> 00:15:12.360
Art: 88 points.

00:15:12.360 --> 00:15:14.220
Performance: 87 points.

00:15:14.230 --> 00:15:18.310
Total: 432 out of 500 points.

00:15:18.310 --> 00:15:21.090
Next, Team Tachibana.

00:15:21.090 --> 00:15:23.250
Flavour: 84 points.

00:15:23.250 --> 00:15:24.820
Skills: 58 points.

00:15:24.820 --> 00:15:27.370
Theme: 84 points.

00:15:27.370 --> 00:15:29.190
Art: 55 points.

00:15:29.190 --> 00:15:31.050
Performance: 87 points.

00:15:29.340 --> 00:15:34.910
It looks like the collapse really hurt their skills and art scores.

00:15:31.050 --> 00:15:33.820
Total: 368 points.

00:15:35.190 --> 00:15:37.870
Result: The winner of this battle is Team Ichigo.

00:15:37.880 --> 00:15:41.870
That can't be... I feel so sorry for Tachibana-senpai's team!

00:15:41.870 --> 00:15:45.590
I'm going to ask the judges to let them make it again then rejudge!

00:15:45.590 --> 00:15:46.340
Amano!

00:15:46.340 --> 00:15:47.280
Amano-san!

00:15:47.280 --> 00:15:51.340
It's fine. It was our fault that we didn't make the base solid enough.

00:15:51.350 --> 00:15:57.420
Also, we got too eager and added too many feathers, which backfired.

00:15:57.420 --> 00:16:04.020
I suppose we really are better off making simple sweets than a showy cake in the Grand Prix.

00:16:04.600 --> 00:16:06.730
This really made us realise that.

00:16:07.170 --> 00:16:09.230
Tachibana-senpai...

00:16:11.950 --> 00:16:16.450
Let's hurry! The battle between Ojou and the President is about to start!

00:16:16.460 --> 00:16:21.190
The theme is elegance. With that, please begin.

00:16:26.150 --> 00:16:30.670
Satou, you're on the meringue. Shiotani, you handle the jelly. Yohko, preheat the oven.

00:16:42.430 --> 00:16:42.780
Elegance

00:16:50.230 --> 00:16:55.740
How should I put it... it's like they're performing the sweets making itself with elegance.

00:16:56.700 --> 00:17:00.450
Wonderful fragrance... as one would expect of something costing 500 yen each.

00:16:56.700 --> 00:17:00.470
TL Note: Roughly $6 USD each.

00:17:02.960 --> 00:17:07.630
I'll fascinate everyone in this hall with the fragrance of high-grade fruit!

00:17:07.620 --> 00:17:09.090
There!

00:17:15.480 --> 00:17:18.460
Ahh, all the fruits smell so good!

00:17:18.460 --> 00:17:23.930
The distance it takes to travel to the receptacles is all so the fruits' scent can propagate throughout the hall.

00:17:24.190 --> 00:17:27.650
That's not all. They're shining spotlights too...

00:17:28.030 --> 00:17:31.320
Amazing! They're all flashing just like a rainbow!

00:17:31.840 --> 00:17:38.160
By doing this, they've turned the dull and simple straining into a fine performance.

00:17:40.140 --> 00:17:44.250
This smells like coffee! Also, it's real Blue Mountain!

00:17:40.140 --> 00:17:48.580
TL Note: Blue Mountain is a coffee grown in the mountains of Jamaica with the same name.

00:17:44.250 --> 00:17:46.910
It's a high-class item that's pretty hard to get your hands on!

00:17:46.910 --> 00:17:48.580
Nice, Cafe!

00:17:51.380 --> 00:17:53.440
What's with this smell!?

00:17:53.440 --> 00:17:58.220
How dare you cover up the fruits' scent that I just spread throughout the hall!

00:18:19.220 --> 00:18:22.330
Ojou's team is battling with Western European elegance, huh?

00:18:22.330 --> 00:18:26.930
It's a Rococo king's crown. Perhaps it gives the image of France's elegant culture?

00:18:22.330 --> 00:18:28.740
TL Note: a.k.a. "Late Baroque", an 18th century style where artists gave up symmetry for ostentatiousness.

00:18:26.930 --> 00:18:28.770
Amazing! Too amazing!

00:18:28.770 --> 00:18:34.250
<i>I'll let everyone know what the true meaning of elephants - I mean, elegance - really is!</i>

00:18:34.250 --> 00:18:36.920
Shiotani, have the white chocolates hardened?

00:18:36.920 --> 00:18:38.470
Yes. They're perfect!

00:18:43.450 --> 00:18:47.180
Once I put all these parts together, my elegant crown will be complete!

00:18:49.370 --> 00:18:51.690
Huh? What's she up to this time?

00:18:54.720 --> 00:18:58.160
Amazing! She's writing so smoothly even without a draft!

00:18:58.160 --> 00:19:01.360
Without an outstanding artistic sense, you can't do something as daring as that!

00:19:11.070 --> 00:19:14.420
<i>Amazing! I just can't take my eyes off Tennouji-san!</i>

00:19:14.420 --> 00:19:16.910
Fifteen minutes remaining.

00:19:17.820 --> 00:19:19.420
It's done!

00:19:19.940 --> 00:19:23.600
This crown is the shining symbol of my supreme path towards victory!

00:19:25.280 --> 00:19:26.920
<i>Très bien!</i>

00:19:27.470 --> 00:19:29.140
Is that a figure of Kannon?

00:19:27.470 --> 00:19:30.770
TL Note: Kannon (觀音) is the Buddhist bodhisattva of mercy and compassion.

00:19:30.780 --> 00:19:35.570
No, that's not Kannon-sama... it's a celestial maiden in heavenly raiment...

00:19:39.250 --> 00:19:42.910
A celestial maiden has descended upon us...

00:19:42.910 --> 00:19:45.410
Well then, we shall now start the scoring.

00:19:52.530 --> 00:19:55.760
And now, we shall now announce the results.

00:19:55.760 --> 00:19:56.920
Team Koshiro.

00:19:57.450 --> 00:19:59.080
Taste: 90 points.

00:19:59.080 --> 00:20:00.780
Skills: 91 points.

00:20:00.780 --> 00:20:02.720
Theme: 90 points.

00:20:02.720 --> 00:20:04.900
Art: 93 points.

00:20:04.900 --> 00:20:07.350
Performance: 90 points.

00:20:07.350 --> 00:20:09.930
Total: 454 points.

00:20:10.490 --> 00:20:12.100
454 points!?

00:20:12.100 --> 00:20:13.160
Awesome!

00:20:13.160 --> 00:20:15.310
Next, Team Tennouji.

00:20:15.310 --> 00:20:17.650
Flavour: 94 points.

00:20:17.650 --> 00:20:19.650
Skills: 95 points.

00:20:19.650 --> 00:20:21.630
Theme: 95 points.

00:20:21.640 --> 00:20:23.720
Art: 98 points.

00:20:23.720 --> 00:20:25.740
Performance: 96 points.

00:20:25.740 --> 00:20:29.330
Total: 478 points.

00:20:31.380 --> 00:20:35.170
Result: The winner of this battle is Team Tennouji.

00:20:35.170 --> 00:20:38.320
Impossible! How could I lose!?

00:20:38.320 --> 00:20:40.880
Team Koshiro's cake was also excellent.

00:20:41.360 --> 00:20:43.750
Well then, how should I say this...

00:20:43.750 --> 00:20:50.160
Elegance should not only be alluring, but must be graceful as well.

00:20:50.160 --> 00:20:52.500
That was probably what made the difference.

00:20:52.500 --> 00:20:55.020
Make sure to keep improving yourselves!

00:20:55.020 --> 00:21:00.740
Ojou lost even with a total of 454 points... Tennouji-san is just too amazing.

00:21:00.740 --> 00:21:02.280
Amano-san!

00:21:02.550 --> 00:21:04.990
Make sure you win the Cake Grand Prix!

00:21:05.520 --> 00:21:07.620
We'll be cheering for you!

00:21:08.270 --> 00:21:10.160
T-Thank you very much!

00:21:10.550 --> 00:21:12.060
We've gotta do it.

00:21:13.530 --> 00:21:19.880
<i>Henri-sensei, Team Ichigo has made it through the first round of the Cake Grand Prix!</i>

