00:23:03.410 --> 00:23:05.030
Pièce montée!

00:23:06.650 --> 00:23:12.390
Pièce montée is a large snack made from combining industrial arts and other snacks together.

00:23:13.420 --> 00:23:18.070
You can observe them very well through the pâtissièrie's show window, for example.

00:23:18.070 --> 00:23:22.850
Even by just looking, it's fun to see how the pâtissière decorated them,

00:23:22.860 --> 00:23:26.420
keeping the concept of the shop's design in mind, even according to what season it is,

00:23:26.430 --> 00:23:28.830
when he puts it all together in the completed production!

00:23:32.270 --> 00:23:37.120
It was originally born in 19th century France where, on the occasion of entertaining guests,

00:23:37.120 --> 00:23:42.880
one would pile sweets of many different kinds very high on their kitchen table.

00:23:42.880 --> 00:23:47.040
Wedding cakes in marriages can also be pièce montées.

00:23:47.040 --> 00:23:50.430
Of course, all of it is edible!

00:23:53.620 --> 00:23:58.390
The pièce montée certainly embodies the arts well, eh?

00:24:00.890 --> 00:24:06.340
These fresh tropical fruits are glittering like gems! Which should I eat first?

00:24:07.450 --> 00:24:10.570
Ow! Where are you biting, Ichigo!?

00:24:10.570 --> 00:24:12.840
I thought it tasted bitter... it was actually Vanilla!

00:24:12.840 --> 00:24:15.780
How rude! Vanilla is really delicious, you know!

00:24:15.780 --> 00:24:17.030
Really now?

00:24:19.180 --> 00:24:21.090
Next episode, Tropical Paradise.

00:24:21.090 --> 00:24:23.830
